Maintainer: Christoph Rinne <crinne@ufg.uni-kiel.de>
Description:  Provides multiple formulae for human stature estimation to be 
    applied to a given data set. The package reads tabled data of bone
    measurements of each individual. The input function returns the statuAAR
    input object as well as basic statistic for checking the data. The 
    estimation function returns the stature based on the selected formulae.
